{"script":"m_2_3_4","exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"charaName":"贾马尔","text":"[show]你们几个，好像是罗伯特老大的客人？我看到你们刚才从老大家里出来。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_2"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"贾马尔","text":"[show]哦，你们问魔岩矿是吧，这你可问对人了。在采石场被红水晶堵住之前，我就是现场班的班长，魔岩矿就是我带人开采的。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_3"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"贾马尔","text":"[show]你们也知道，采石这个事不光是在井下敲敲打打，各种后勤、支援也都很重要。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_4"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"贾马尔","text":"[show]为了保证所有出了力气的人都能拿到应有的那一份，我们一直都会把所有开采的矿石交给罗伯特老大，由他卖出去之后再把钱按照各人的付出发放下来。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_5"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"贾马尔","text":"[show]所以要问采石场停工之后，村里哪儿还有魔岩矿。我只能说如果真的还有剩，那肯定都在[color=ffb64d]罗伯特老大[colorEnd]那儿，这事你们找他就行。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_6"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"scaleX":1.5,"addImg":"","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"bg","x":-500,"y":-125,"bright":1,"scaleY":1.5,"img":"bgblack"},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0.4,"scaleX":1.5,"addImg":"","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"bg","x":-500,"transTime":300,"y":-125,"bright":1,"scaleY":1.5,"img":"bgblack"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2c","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"chara2","x":360,"y":-180,"bright":1,"scaleY":1,"img":"chara002_2"},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2c","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"chara2","x":360,"transTime":300,"y":-180,"bright":1,"scaleY":1,"img":"chara002_2"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]但采石场都停工了，你们矿工怎么办呢？[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_7"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2c","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"chara2","x":360,"transTime":300,"y":-180,"bright":1,"scaleY":1,"img":"chara002_2"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"scaleX":1.5,"addImg":"","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"bg","x":-500,"transTime":300,"y":-125,"bright":1,"scaleY":1.5,"img":"bgblack"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"charaName":"贾马尔","text":"[show]状况非常糟糕。其实之前和驿站做生意的时候，村里人都赚得不少，所有矿工都还有点积蓄。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_8"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"贾马尔","text":"[show]但是停工的时间越拖越长，加上那些行商人天天涨价，很多人都要坐吃山空了。[l]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_9"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"options":[{"text":"驿站就这么看着？","tag":"tag_10"},{"text":"驿站没有帮你们吗？","tag":"tag_10"}]},"key":"option"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_10"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"贾马尔","text":"[cm][show]驿站曾经想要帮我们。在刚停工那阵子，菲尔德蕾就提出，愿意给我们一笔钱，让大家先渡过难关。但是我们拒绝了。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_11"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"贾马尔","text":"[show]这不是罗伯特老大一个人的决定，是我们集体开大会作出的选择。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_12"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"贾马尔","text":"[show]当时我们都认为困难很快就会过去，并不想要让驿站把手伸到采石场里来……毕竟因为[color=f1401c]大兽潮[colorEnd]的事，山里人对于驿站都没什么信任。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_13"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"scaleX":1.5,"addImg":"","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"bg","x":-500,"y":-125,"bright":1,"scaleY":1.5,"img":"bgblack"},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0.4,"scaleX":1.5,"addImg":"","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"bg","x":-500,"transTime":300,"y":-125,"bright":1,"scaleY":1.5,"img":"bgblack"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2e","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"chara2","x":360,"y":-180,"bright":1,"scaleY":1,"img":"chara002_2"},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2e","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"chara2","x":360,"transTime":300,"y":-180,"bright":1,"scaleY":1,"img":"chara002_2"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]但这么多年都没有好转……是吧？[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_14"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2e","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"chara2","x":360,"transTime":300,"y":-180,"bright":1,"scaleY":1,"img":"chara002_2"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"scaleX":1.5,"addImg":"","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"bg","x":-500,"transTime":300,"y":-125,"bright":1,"scaleY":1.5,"img":"bgblack"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"charaName":"贾马尔","text":"[show]是啊，现在看来，我们当时的决定……没准是错的。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_15"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"贾马尔","text":"[show]但在我们拒绝了驿站之后，菲尔德蕾并没有彻底抛弃我们。山底下还是偶尔会有人运送一些粮食过来，价格也非常便宜。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_16"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"贾马尔","text":"[show]但她作为驿站的老大，肯定要优先对驿站负责。这点援助不能说没用，但还是没法让所有人吃饱。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_17"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"贾马尔","text":"[show]而结果就是，到头来，所有人还是只能依靠那些武装商队贩卖的高价粮食生活。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_18"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"scaleX":1.5,"addImg":"","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"bg","x":-500,"y":-125,"bright":1,"scaleY":1.5,"img":"bgblack"},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0.4,"scaleX":1.5,"addImg":"","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"bg","x":-500,"transTime":300,"y":-125,"bright":1,"scaleY":1.5,"img":"bgblack"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2c","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"chara2","x":360,"y":-180,"bright":1,"scaleY":1,"img":"chara002_2"},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2c","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"chara2","x":360,"transTime":300,"y":-180,"bright":1,"scaleY":1,"img":"chara002_2"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]啊？那这不会出问题吗？[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_19"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2c","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"chara2","x":360,"transTime":300,"y":-180,"bright":1,"scaleY":1,"img":"chara002_2"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"scaleX":1.5,"addImg":"","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"bg","x":-500,"transTime":300,"y":-125,"bright":1,"scaleY":1.5,"img":"bgblack"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"charaName":"贾马尔","text":"[show]当然会了！因为这事，本来团结无比的工人们甚至分裂成了三派！听好了，不是两派，是三派啊！[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_20"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"贾马尔","text":"[show]一派认为我们必须立刻恢复采石场的生产，不惜任何代价，哪怕是工友乃至自身的性命！[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_21"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"贾马尔","text":"[show]这一派主要是一些年轻人，还有一些积蓄比较少，快要断粮的困难户。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_22"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"贾马尔","text":"[show]一派觉得我们还可以再咬牙坚持一段时间，说不定再过段时间，[r]就能找到解决问题的办法。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_23"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"贾马尔","text":"[show]罗伯特老大应该是偏向这一派。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_24"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"scaleX":1.5,"addImg":"","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"bg","x":-500,"y":-125,"bright":1,"scaleY":1.5,"img":"bgblack"},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0.4,"scaleX":1.5,"addImg":"","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"bg","x":-500,"transTime":300,"y":-125,"bright":1,"scaleY":1.5,"img":"bgblack"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2c","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"chara2","x":360,"y":-180,"bright":1,"scaleY":1,"img":"chara002_2"},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2c","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"chara2","x":360,"transTime":300,"y":-180,"bright":1,"scaleY":1,"img":"chara002_2"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]那还有一派呢？[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_25"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2c","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"chara2","x":360,"transTime":300,"y":-180,"bright":1,"scaleY":1,"img":"chara002_2"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"scaleX":1.5,"addImg":"","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"bg","x":-500,"transTime":300,"y":-125,"bright":1,"scaleY":1.5,"img":"bgblack"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"charaName":"贾马尔","text":"[show]还有一派觉得，不如干脆就让驿站接手算了，总好过我们在这里靠自己死撑。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_26"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"贾马尔","text":"[show]不过当初不让驿站插手是我们共同的决定，所以这一派的人都拉不下这个脸来说这个话。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_27"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"贾马尔","text":"[show]唉，仅仅几年之前还是亲密无间的工友，现在走在路上都在互相吐口水。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_28"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"贾马尔","text":"[show]说不定，面对面拔刀的那一天，也马上就要来了吧。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_29"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"scaleX":1.5,"addImg":"","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"bg","x":-500,"y":-125,"bright":1,"scaleY":1.5,"img":"bgblack"},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0.4,"scaleX":1.5,"addImg":"","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"bg","x":-500,"transTime":300,"y":-125,"bright":1,"scaleY":1.5,"img":"bgblack"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2d","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"chara2","x":360,"y":-180,"bright":1,"scaleY":1,"img":"chara002_2"},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2d","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"chara2","x":360,"transTime":300,"y":-180,"bright":1,"scaleY":1,"img":"chara002_2"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]谢谢你。{myName}，我们再去问问别人吧。[l][cm][hide]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_30"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara002_2_face_chara002_2d","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"chara2","x":360,"transTime":300,"y":-180,"bright":1,"scaleY":1,"img":"chara002_2"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"noOut":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"scaleX":1.5,"addImg":"","trans":true,"noIn":false,"layer":"bg","x":-500,"transTime":300,"y":-125,"bright":1,"scaleY":1.5,"img":"bgblack"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"charaName":"","text":"[hide]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"end":true},"key":"end"}],"des":"m_2_3_4"}